{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/LogoHeader.png?t=1744994684\" /><br><br>After decades of infighting between its clans, the insect kingdom seemed to have found balance. Unfortunately, shaking this delicate status quo, a new threat has appeared on the outskirts of the kingdom. Tales have reached the capital of insects being taken over by unusual fungal aberrations. Faced with a common enemy, the clans set aside their differences for now and send their best warriors to face off against this mysterious looming plague.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ChooseParty.png?t=1744994684\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ChooseParty_3.gif?t=1744994684\" /><br><br>Use your strategic senses to pick the best insectoid recruits to face the fungal monstrosities! Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, and it\u2019s up to you to make good use of them!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/FightInvasion.png?t=1744994684\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/FightTheInvasion_1.gif?t=1744994684\" /><br><br>Face the threat head-on! Find the best placement and strategy to defeat your opponents and break through the enemy lines!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/GetRewards.png?t=1744994684\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/GetRewards_1.gif?t=1744994684\" /><br><br>Collect nectar after each confrontation\u2014it will heal your fighters and support your economy. It is the most precious resource. 